WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
That night

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,040
I dreamed of a man whose face he couldn’t see clearly

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,600
It is said that three days later the Guanyin Hall in Xiushan Mountain will be hidden

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,380
Destiny is waiting for me, Zhou Tie

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,820
Can you help me establish a church?

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,620
Although he is four years older than me

7
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,460
But if I help him establish a church

8
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,100
I am the master

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,740
What about this master-disciple status?

10
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,140
It doesn't matter, Zhou Tie

11
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,740
Meeting each other is also fate

12
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,500
The truth that everything cannot be forced

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,140
I still understand Zhou Tie

14
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,220
We are destined to meet again

15
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,300
wait for me

16
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,900
It’s not that I can’t help you right away

17
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,260
If I give you a court appearance

18
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,860
Then it can only be your established master.

19
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,020
It can't be another identity

20
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,220
Otherwise

21
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:36,600
do you still want

22
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,640
So be it

23
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,120
I'll take a photo of my Litang master.

24
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,240
Let me establish a hall for you

25
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,670
Then we are brothers and sisters

26
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,390
Is this okay?

27
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:49,620
Then you have to call me senior brother from now on

28
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,420
Lao Liu, do you have time to come to Yinxiu Mountain?

29
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,860
I took over the job of setting up a court for you.

30
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,920
Why do you let me go through this trouble?

31
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,320
Just say whether you will come or not.

32
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:59,300
The boy who established the church is a girl who is twenty-three years old.

33
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,580
I understand Zhou Tie

34
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,780
You had an affair
